Use a prebuilt shaders.metallib instead of invoking xcrun metal/metallib

Apple's Metal compiler is not available under Nix. Build the metallib on macOS
with `scripts/build-metallib.py`, commit it next to package.nix, and copy it
into OUT_DIR during the Rust build.

Regenerate with `scripts/build-metallib.py` whenever the pinned warp rev or
`shaders.metal` changes

